Z||000007||walsh2001||04-12-2001||11:33 AM||||84 coupe:<P>week 1:<BR>fine<P>week 2:<BR>threw belt, engine overheated, coasted into parking lot.<P>week 3: <BR>threw belt in gas station, coolant everywhere<P>week 5:<BR>threw belt in parking lot<P>week 8:<BR>Shift retainer clip falls off, something in clutch goes snap. Coast into diary queen<BR>Jury rig clip with hanging wire, shifting wierd but ok<P>week 9:<BR>Oil leaking like a seive<P>week 10:<BR>Starter fries, stranded in parking lot, towed to shop. Seals replaced.<P>and I still love my "Black Wedge of Death!!!"<BR>||||reg||6
